    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "c18bf5b931dd3f118a7c1639639edd5222c35f74224d83b03c2c903f0bbab46f",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "いや、だって、ヴェラートゥさんはバレンタインみたいな\nイベントに興味がないと思ってましたから。\n手作りチョコを配るなんて、良い意味で驚いたんですよ。",
      "jp_sha256": "19f2b685cad343b3b804bda529d9abc0eb27a862a0d0cf62364ec60c99ef463c",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아니, 베라투 씨는 밸런타인데이 같은\n행사에는 관심이 없을 줄 알았거든요.\n수제 초콜릿을 나눠 준다니, 좋은 의미로 놀랐어요.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 10,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b006-20261106-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "8a1505ddf8e8db1a8d8febe4250d36e7f394786991e62183d8e7f44cca2baf09:000001_-1288365324374089629:g0:r9",
      "row_index_0based": 9,
      "serialized_row_index": 9,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "いや、だって、ヴェラートゥさんはバレンタインみたいな\nイベントに興味がないと思ってましたから。\n手作りチョコを配るなんて、良い意味で驚いたんですよ。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
